config BR2_PACKAGE_YELLOW_OVERLAYS
	bool "Home Assistant Yellow device tree overlays"
	help
	  Optional device tree overlays for Home Assistant Yellow,
	  applied by the user via dtoverlay= entries in config.txt.

	  ha-yellow-bt-pl011 (CM4 only): route the Bluetooth HCI UART
	  through the PL011 (uart0, fixed clock, hardware flow control)
	  instead of the mini-UART. Workaround for unrecoverable HCI
	  failures caused by mini-UART FIFO overruns. Disables the
	  UART on the J11 pin header.
